#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:661
msgid ""
"The shipping phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the "
"billing phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Die veld vir die afleweringstelefoonnommer kan as &quot;verpligtend&quot; "
"gestel word indien die faktuuradres-afdeling na die "
"afleweringsadres-afdeling vertoon word, en die faktuurtelefoon-veld as "
"&quot;verpligtend&quot; gestel is. Dit is nodig om te verseker dat die "
"afleweringsadres na die faktuuradres gekopieer kan word wanneer daardie "
"opsie gemerk is, anders kan die kliënt dalk nie die afhandelingsvorm "
"voltooi nie."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:687
msgid ""
"The billing phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the "
"shipping phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Die faktuurnommerveld kan as &quot;verpligtend&quot; gestel word indien die "
"faktuuradres-afdeling voor die afleweringsadres-afdeling vertoon word, en "
"die afleweringsnommerveld as &quot;verpligtend&quot; gestel is. Dit is "
"nodig om te verseker dat die afleweringsadres na die faktuuradres gekopieer "
"kan word wanneer daardie opsie gemerk is, anders kan die kliënt dalk nie "
"die afhandelingsvorm voltooi nie."

