"kliënt- of gebruikersdata word ooit gestuur nie."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-tools.php:102
msgid ""
"Nothing is sent right away unless you choose to send it. After that, usage "
"data is sent about once a week, or about every 4 weeks if nothing has "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Niks word dadelik gestuur tensy jy kies om dit te stuur nie. Daarna word "
"gebruiksdata ongeveer een keer per week gestuur, of ongeveer elke 4 weke as "
"niks verander het nie."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-tools.php:110
msgid "Basic environment"
msgstr "Basiese omgewing"

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-tools.php:111
msgid ""
"Included whenever usage tracking is on. WordPress, PHP and WooCommerce "
"versions, language, store country, currency and timezone, your active "
"theme, and your installed plugins and their versions, including whether "
"each plugin is active. Also your site domain, whether this is a multisite, "
"and when Fluid Checkout plugins were first activated. A paid Fluid Checkout "
"plugin can include a hashed license key, not the key itself."
msgstr ""
"Ingesluit wanneer gebruiksopsporing aan is. WordPress-, PHP- en "
"WooCommerce-weergawes, taal, winkelland, geldeenheid en tydsone, jou "
"aktiewe tema, en jou geïnstalleerde inproppe en hul weergawes, insluitend "
"of elke inprop aktief is. Ook jou webwerfdomein, of dit &#39;n multiwerf "
"is, en wanneer Fluid Checkout-inproppe die eerste keer geaktiveer is. "
"&#39;n Betaalde Fluid Checkout-inprop kan &#39;n gehashte lisensiesleutel "
"insluit, nie die sleutel self nie."

